FlexibleBoardViewer

Boardview file-format parsing logic in crates/fbv-parsers is ported from
OpenBoardView (https://github.com/OpenBoardView/OpenBoardView), used under
the MIT License. Copyright (c) the OpenBoardView contributors.

XZZ PCB format understanding is credited to @inflex, @MuertoGB and
@huertas via the OpenBoardView project. Teboview format research by
@inflex (https://github.com/inflex/teboviewformat).

No decryption keys for encrypted formats (ASUS FZ, XZZ PCB) are included
in this repository; users supply their own keys in Settings, mirroring
OpenBoardView's configuration approach.
